OL,3,GNEWSAMore Tube lines disrupted as
OL,4,ALondon Underground strike takes hold
OL,5,
OL,6,F"This is costing us a lot," a cafe
OL,7,Fowner tells the BBC, as he says the
OL,8,Fstrike has led to fewer customers,
OL,9,Fwhile London's Mayor Sadiq Khan is
OL,10,Furging TfL and RMT to resolve their
OL,11,Fdispute
OL,13,FThe disagreement centres around the
OL,14,Fproposed voluntary introduction of a
OL,15,Ffour-day working week with condensed
OL,16,Fhours. Read more about why drivers are
OL,17,Fstriking
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
